WEBVTT

00:03:57.996 --> 00:04:00.996
there is no courage without vulnerability.

00:04:01.704 --> 00:04:05.996
Then a week later, I'm doing work with
Pete Carroll and the Seattle Seahawks.

00:04:06.329 --> 00:04:07.663
We're talking about vulnerability.

00:04:07.663 --> 00:04:09.788
I asked the same question to
that group of players.

00:04:09.954 --> 00:04:13.038
Give me an example of
courage on the field

00:04:13.038 --> 00:04:14.996
or off that doesn't require vulnerability.

00:04:14.996 --> 00:04:17.829
And it was so funny to me because they
they had to huddle for a minute

00:04:18.621 --> 00:04:24.746
and then they kind of came back and said,
there is no courage without vulnerability,

00:04:24.871 --> 00:04:28.579
not on or off the field. If you're not
all in if you're not putting yourself

00:04:28.579 --> 00:04:30.538
out there, you just can't be brave.